<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Aug foreign reserves fall to $2.344 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Aug foreign reserves fall to $2.344 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the monthly foreign exchange reserve holdings position in Pakistan:</p>
<p>    (MLN DLRS)		AUGUST     JULY	  JULY 1995</p>
<p> TOTAL			   2,344	2,463	 2,821</p>
<p> Forex in Pakistan	   1,025	1,263	 1,877</p>
<p> Forex outside Pakistan	555	  418	   171</p>
<p> Gold coins and bullion	762	  768	   772</p>
<p> Special Drawing Rights	  2	   14	     1</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
